/-- `thm:stabunitary`: stabilizer of `U ψ` is the conjugate of `Stab(ψ)`.

In set-theoretic form: `Stab(U ψ) = U · Stab(ψ) · U⁻¹`.
Spelled out, every `G ∈ Stab(U ψ)` is of the form `U G' U⁻¹` for some
`G' ∈ Stab(ψ)`, and vice versa.

